<title>USA: Maurice River Twp BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Maurice River Twp BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $2.994 million of Maurice River Township Board of Education, N.J., school bonds, Series 1997, with a lowest rate of 5.45, highest price of 100.0448.</p>
</text>
